Third-Party Licenses
====================

Radiotrope depends on the following third-party libraries that have licenses
differing from the project's GPL-3.0-or-later license. All other dependencies
are under permissive licenses (mostly MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC or Zlib) that
are compatible with the GPL version 3.


Slint
-----
GUI toolkit.

License: GNU General Public License version 3 (one of three license options)
Source:  https://github.com/slint-ui/slint
SPDX:   GPL-3.0-only OR LicenseRef-Slint-Royalty-free-2.0 OR LicenseRef-Slint-Software-3.0

Radiotrope uses Slint under its GPL-3.0 option. Because Slint offers only
version 3 of the GPL, distributed Radiotrope binaries that include Slint are
effectively under GPL-3.0.


